 Install: `npm i -g agent-browser && agent-browser install`
 
+**On NixOS** (no global npm), get the binary from the [`numtide/llm-agents.nix`](https://github.com/numtide/llm-agents.nix) flake instead:
+
+```bash
+# One-off run
+nix run github:numtide/llm-agents.nix#agent-browser -- --version
+
+# Pin the store path once, reuse across commands (shell state doesn't persist between calls)
+AB=$(nix build --no-link --print-out-paths github:numtide/llm-agents.nix#agent-browser)/bin/agent-browser
+"$AB" skills get core
+```
+
+The flake ships a runnable Chrome, so `agent-browser install` / `--with-deps` is unnecessary — verify with `"$AB" doctor --offline --quick`.
+
